# Ship It — always-on rules

- Stack is locked in `docs/TECHNICAL.md` (Vite/React 19/TS strict/Tailwind/Zustand/pnpm/Vitest).
- Product decisions live in `docs/PRODUCT.md` — do not reopen; file follow-ups.
- UI and docs copy: **English only**.
- When changing a game area, read and update the matching `docs/modules/*.md` in the same change.
- Player-facing UI must follow `docs/modules/ui.md` (palette, type, spacing, motion).
- Economy helpers stay pure (`src/game/economy.ts`); unit-test formulas.
- From roadmap #3 onward, create GitHub issues with the `create-issue` skill; **do not invent labels** (see `docs/ISSUES.md`).
- Prefer `pnpm` scripts; CI expects Node 24 + frozen lockfile.
